Structural sparsity and pruning Fine-grained $2{:}4$ sparsity doubles matmul throughput on Ampere GPUs \cite{hu-2024-accelerating}. Graph-level sparsifiers such as GST \cite{zhang-2024-two} or unified lottery tickets \cite{chen-2021-unified} reduce edge count. HASHPIPE-GAT is orthogonal to these methods: it preserves the original graph and can be combined with sparsification for additional gains.  
