Implementation details The complete pipeline is expressed as a custom \texttt{torch.autograd.Function} in CUDA C++. The kernel launches 256 threads per block for high occupancy. Sketch hashes are pre-generated INT8 constants; accumulations run in FP16 under automatic mixed precision. Model weights follow $2{:}4$ sparsity with magnitude-guided regrowth every five epochs \cite{hu-2024-accelerating}, and activations are compressed during back-propagation via GACT \cite{liu-2022-gact}.  
